diff --git a/release-log.txt b/release-log.txt
index 7f4613f16..ed25a073b 100644
--- a/release-log.txt
+++ b/release-log.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 -- Oozie 4.1.0 release (trunk - unreleased)

+OOZIE-1660 DB connection misconfig causes all or most unit tests to fail (rkanter)
